  "stem": "The function \\(f\\) is defined by \\(f(x) = ax - 7\\), where \\(a\\) is a constant. If \\(f(3) = 11\\), what is the value of \\(a\\)?",
  "figure": null,
  "answer_type": "spr",
  "choices": null,
  "answer": null,
  "spr_answers": [
    "6"
  ],
  "solution": [
    "\\(f(3) = 3a - 7 = 11\\).",
    "So \\(3a = 18\\) and \\(a = 6\\)."
  ],
  "explanation": null,
